  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_027 (multimodal, multiprofile, scgpt + imagenet_vit_l, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieved 0.52 validation accuracy. This experiment tests whether simplifying the aggregation (avgpool) and fusion (concat) methods while keeping the same encoders could maintain similar accuracy at lower cost. Avgpool and concat are less computationally intensive than transformer and weighted fusion, so this is a cost-effective way to explore parameter variations. It clarifies whether the previous accuracy was due to specific components or general multimodal setup, balancing exploitation of promising encoders with cost-efficient exploration."  
